amountPaidForSecurities.p1 = Enter the total amount of consideration given in exchange for these securities as a cash amount.
amountPaidForSecurities.p2 = You do not need to provide details about conversion or exchange rates, or how valuations of non-monetary items were reached.
amountPaidForSecurities.hint = For example, £600 or £193.54
